Error [jet.InvalidMembersList]: `members:` must evaluate to a list of package paths
  --> workspace.jet:1:30
    |
  1 | workspace: module { members: 42 }
    |                              ^^
 Why: The `members:` value must evaluate to a `[String]` — a list of relative package directory paths
 Fix: Example: `members: find("./packages")` or `members: ["./pkg/hello"]`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0996
